  task0Message: 'Objective: Unlock the door to the living space.'
  task1Message: 'Objective: Pick up the picture on the table in the living space.'
  task2Message: 'Objective: Visit the bathroom.'
  task3Message: 'Objective: Solve the color puzzle in Brandon''s room.'
  task4Message: 'Objective: Pick up the teddy bear on Brandon''s bed.'
  task5Message: 'Objective: Visit Lily''s room upstairs.'
  task6Message: 'Objective: Pick up the book on the shelf in Lily''s room.'
  task7Message: 'Objective: Collect all missing map pieces to open the main bedroom.'
